{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y为了压缩信息，删掉了几处重要的心理因果和前后回扣，例如S07对方也能从陪伴中获得安心、S09害怕对方不再愿意相处、S14眼下仍然亲近才让他不再强求保证，人物内心的来龙去脉不如X完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词加亮让普通观众扫屏时能迅速抓住每段发生了什么、人物情绪转向哪里，交替出现的感受句也更容易与音乐对应，尤其是标注到时出现的部分，避免提前看到而失去音乐中的发现感。X保留了更多心理动机、犹豫过程和前后照应，因此理解人物为什么这样、看清整条心理变化链条更有优势，但右侧短词堆叠较多，部分意象重复、抽象甚至略显生硬。综合实际观看体验，我选Y：它在有限停留时间里更容易让人既看懂又感受到，而且感受表达更具体、克制，也更贴合音乐。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7f4349b6-1f71-4e1d-8516-d8e0147bcf43", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T021627983321Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:17:15.051769+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f7d0f269d83082e81ff649fedc334b2e0d989d48fcab693e189ba805804cf0eb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa